# A field moves from a class to its parent class.
=== initial
@expect-output 7
--- Main.hx
class Main {
	static function main() {
		trace(new Child().value());
	}
}
--- Base.hx
class Base {
	public function new() {}
}
--- Child.hx
class Child extends Base {
	public function value() return 7;
}

=== moved to the parent
@expect-output 7
--- Base.hx
class Base {
	public function new() {}
	public function value() return 7;
}
--- Child.hx
class Child extends Base {}
